    "custom_liquid_4PhgQT": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n  .faq-section {\n    max-width: 900px;\n    width: 100%;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 40px 16px;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .faq-title {\n    font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 42px);\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 32px;\n  }\n  .faq-item {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #ebe4fb;\n  }\n  .faq-item:first-child {\n    border-top: 1px solid #ebe4fb;\n  }\n  .faq-question {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 14px;\n    padding: 18px 16px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    background: #fff;\n    transition: background 0.2s ease;\n  }\n  .faq-question:hover {\n    background: #fbf9ff;\n  }\n  .faq-item.active .faq-question {\n    background: #f8f5fe;\n  }\n  .faq-icon {\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    width: 22px;\n    height: 22px;\n    color: #7B5FE8;\n  }\n  .faq-icon svg {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    display: block;\n  }\n  .faq-question-text {\n    flex: 1;\n    font-size: clamp(15px, 2vw, 17px);\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n  .faq-item.active .faq-question-text {\n    color: #7B5FE8;\n  }\n  .faq-chevron {\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    width: 16px;\n    height: 16px;\n    color: #7B5FE8;\n    transition: transform 0.3s ease;\n  }\n  .faq-item.active .faq-chevron {\n    transform: rotate(180deg);\n  }\n  .faq-answer {\n    max-height: 0;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    transition: max-height 0.3s ease;\n    padding: 0 16px 0 52px;\n    background: #f8f5fe;\n  }\n  .faq-item.active .faq-answer {\n    max-height: 400px;\n    padding-bottom: 18px;\n  }\n  .faq-answer p {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: clamp(14px, 1.8vw, 16px);\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #444;\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 500px) {\n    .faq-answer {\n      padding-left: 40px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"faq-section\">\n  <div class=\"faq-title\">Frequently Asked Questions</div>\n\n  <div class=\"faq-list\">\n    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n      <div class=\"faq-question\">\n        <span class=\"faq-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0c0 1.5-2.5 2-2.5 3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"17\" r=\"0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg></span>\n        <span class=\"faq-question-text\">Why is the brightener pink?</span>\n        <span class=\"faq-chevron\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n        <p>The pink tint is intentional. It sits opposite blue and purple on the color wheel, so it cancels out the shadows that make dark circles look grey. Once blended, the pink disappears into your skin and leaves your under-eyes looking bright and natural.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n      <div class=\"faq-question\">\n        <span class=\"faq-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0c0 1.5-2.5 2-2.5 3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"17\" r=\"0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg></span>\n        <span class=\"faq-question-text\">Will it crease into my fine lines?</span>\n        <span class=\"faq-chevron\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n        <p>No. EyeCorrect+ is designed for mature skin, with a creamy, flexible formula that melts in without settling into lines. It gives up to 12 hours of comfortable wear, and 92% of users said it stayed crease-free all day.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n      <div class=\"faq-question\">\n        <span class=\"faq-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0c0 1.5-2.5 2-2.5 3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"17\" r=\"0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg></span>\n        <span class=\"faq-question-text\">Will it work on my skin tone?</span>\n        <span class=\"faq-chevron\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n        <p>EyeCorrect+ is a color-correcting base, not a skin-tone concealer. It works underneath your natural complexion to neutralize blue and purple tones. Apply a thin layer, tap it in, and add a little concealer on top if you want extra coverage.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n      <div class=\"faq-question\">\n        <span class=\"faq-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0c0 1.5-2.5 2-2.5 3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"17\" r=\"0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg></span>\n        <span class=\"faq-question-text\">Do I still need concealer?</span>\n        <span class=\"faq-chevron\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n        <p>It's up to you. Wear it alone for a naturally brightened, no-makeup look, or use it as a base under concealer. Because it neutralizes darkness first, most customers find they need much less concealer and it no longer looks cakey.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n      <div class=\"faq-question\">\n        <span class=\"faq-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0c0 1.5-2.5 2-2.5 3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"17\" r=\"0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg></span>\n        <span class=\"faq-question-text\">Is it safe for sensitive skin?</span>\n        <span class=\"faq-chevron\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n        <p>Yes. EyeCorrect+ is fragrance-free, hypoallergenic, and dermatologist tested. It contains Bisabolol to soothe delicate skin, along with Hyaluronic Acid, Caffeine, Niacinamide, and Tripeptide-1. As with any new product, we recommend a patch test before first use.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n      <div class=\"faq-question\">\n        <span class=\"faq-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0c0 1.5-2.5 2-2.5 3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"17\" r=\"0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg></span>\n        <span class=\"faq-question-text\">How long does shipping take, and what if it doesn't work for me?</span>\n        <span class=\"faq-chevron\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n        <p>Orders typically arrive within 6 to 10 days, and you'll get a tracking link by email. If you're not happy, contact us within 30 days of delivery at hello@rumicosmetiques.com for a full refund.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n      <div class=\"faq-question\" data-link=\"https://rumicosmetiques.com/a/loop_subscriptions/customer\">\n        <span class=\"faq-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0c0 1.5-2.5 2-2.5 3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"17\" r=\"0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg></span>\n        <span class=\"faq-question-text\">Manage your subscription</span>\n        <span class=\"faq-chevron\" style=\"transform: rotate(-90deg);\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function() {\n  document.querySelectorAll('.faq-question').forEach(q => {\n    q.addEventListener('click', function() {\n      const link = this.getAttribute('data-link');\n      if (link) {\n        window.location.href = link;\n        return;\n      }\n      const item = this.parentElement;\n      const wasActive = item.classList.contains('active');\n      document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item').forEach(i => i.classList.remove('active'));\n      if (!wasActive) item.classList.add('active');\n    });\n  });\n})();\n</script>",
